flowchart LR
	MOD["the module composes its own message strings, byte-exact"] --> APPEND["the factory's Append layer adds the<br/>hook-dsh-ccr prefix and the timestamp -<br/>never the module"]
	APPEND --> FILE["the durable file lines -<br/>the [ISO] message forms"]
	MOD --> BUD["the budget eviction form:<br/>ccr: evicted hash, then budget"]
	BUD -. "the TTL eviction shares the budget eviction's form" .-> TTL["ccr: evicted hash, then ttl"]
